      "module": "lesen",
      "title": "A Family Trip to the Mountains",
      "text": "Last summer, my family and I decided to spend a week in the mountains. We had never been there before, so we were all very excited. We packed our bags and left early on Saturday morning. The drive was long, but the scenery was beautiful. When we arrived, we checked into a small wooden cabin. It was perfect (1) _____ us. The next day, we went hiking. My father wanted to climb the highest peak, but my mother preferred to stay near the lake. In the end, we (2) _____ a compromise and chose a path that went through the forest. It was quite challenging (3) _____ times, but we enjoyed every moment. During the trip, we saw many interesting animals, including a deer. We also took (4) _____ of photos to show our friends back home. On our last night, we sat outside and looked at the stars. It was (5) _____ most peaceful experience I have ever had. We all agreed that we would definitely like to return (6) _____ year.",
